  "id": "voltage",
  "neon": "#5cd6ff",
  "note": "Re-cut to THREE masses after the five-mass version read as noise. The rules it is built to: fewer and bigger parts; ONE continuous glazed band at street level, divided by mullions rather than punched into separate windows; a canopy deep enough that its magenta soffit is what you see from a cab; and exactly two signs — the marquee across the frontage and the roof gantry. The crown takes a different palette so the silhouette carries a light value instead of being one tone top to bottom. RENDER_TUNE.legacyArms puts the nightclub arm back.",
